{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57199","headline":"十四科头 色空不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 色空不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"法性本无青黄，衆生谩造六神。\n吾我说他止观，自意扰扰颠狂。\n不识圆通妙理，何时得会真常？\n自疾不能治疗，却教他人药方。\n外看将爲是善。\n心内犹若豺狼。\n愚人畏其地狱，智者不异天堂。\n对境心常不起，举足皆是道场。\n佛与衆生不二，衆生自作分张。\n若欲除却三毒，迢迢不离灾殃。\n智者知心是佛，愚人乐往西方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}